,"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS","html_url":"https://github.com/BenEklundCS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T01:12:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T04:17:21Z","body":"Updated commit fixes the scaling by computing a scale_factor when the picker goes out of bounds and applying it.\r\n\r\nI switched to:\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst int focused_window = DisplayServer::get_singleton()->get_focused_window();\r\nconst Size2 window_size = DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_get_size(focused_window);\r\n```\r\n\r\nrather than `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->screen_get_usable_rect(get_window()->get_current_screen()).size` since the screen usable rect isn’t the right bound in Single Window Mode.\r\n\r\nNote: updating child `custom_minimum_size` from `NOTIFICATION_RESIZED` can trigger a few relayout passes while the editor layout settles, so you may see repeated resize notifications (mostly obvious with debug logging).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752412518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752836979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114939#issuecomment-3752836979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114939","id":3752836979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fr79z","user":{"login":"BenEklundCS","id":101027885,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgWQLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101027885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS","html_url":"https://github.com/BenEklundCS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenEklundCS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T04:16:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T04:16:08Z","body":"Added a `preset_just_toggled` flag to prevent the resize loop behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752836979/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3754102034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114939#issuecomment-3754102034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114939","id":3754102034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fww0S","user":{"login":"llama-nl","id":94882246,"node_id":"U_kgDOB